### UI - Login Success
POST {{SERVER}}/kame-house/login
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### UI - Login Failed
POST {{SERVER}}/kame-house/login
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### UI - Logout
POST {{SERVER}}/kame-house/logout
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}


### UI Sample - Dragonball Model and View (with name)
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house/api/v1/ui/sample/dragonball/model-and-view?name=kakarotto
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### UI Sample - Dragonball Model and View
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house/api/v1/ui/sample/dragonball/model-and-view
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}


### UI Session - Status
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house/api/{{apiVersion}}/ui/session/status
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}


### UI Static - Home
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house/

### UI Static - Not found
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house/not-found-page


### Commons - Set log level to TRACE
PUT {{SERVER}}/kame-house/api/{{apiVersion}}/commons/log-level/trace
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}


### Error - PUT test
PUT {{SERVER}}/kame-house/api/{{apiVersion}}/com

### Error - GET test
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house/goku
